# The served catalogue PDF (private/catalogs/<slug>/<file>.pdf) IS committed so
# the gated download route can serve it on Vercel — it lives outside /public and
# is only reachable through the authorized API. Optional working/source files
# under a per-catalogue source/ folder stay out of git.
private/catalogs/*/source/
